<title>SINGAPORE: EU council agrees with U.S. on ITA pact - spokesman.</title>
<headline>EU council agrees with U.S. on ITA pact - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Union spokesman said on Thursday the 15 member European Union Concil of trade ministers endorsed an agreement with the United States on a global information technology trade pact.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the council mandated EU Trade Commisioner Sir LeonBrittan to seek broader support from other countries for the information technology agreement (ITA) to eliminate tariffs on a wide range of computer products.</p>
</text>
